public/email-preview.html

# Physical-device capture screenshots. Kept out of the repository deliberately: they are large
# (~38 MB for a few passes), they carry seeded test-account data, and their evidentiary value is
# the written result, not the pixels. The dated RESULTS.md and performance .txt files in the same
# folders ARE tracked — those are the evidence. See docs/native-design/current/README.md.
docs/native-design/current/**/*.png

# Generated SBOM (npm run sbom). Regenerate per release candidate rather than committing drift.
sbom.cyclonedx.json
